
PROFILE:

Ricardo has been
winning people over
since he was a boy -
partly the looks,
mostly the talk.
When there's a
dispute to settle or
a bargain to strike
with outsiders, he's
the one Villa sends.
Idle days, he puts
on a show.
Ask him for anything
else and you'll be
disappointed. But a
good tongue keeps a
man alive out there
longer than most
things do.